  "description": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE – VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\nRAY COOKE Lettings take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 3 bed / 2 bath mid-terrace property to the letting market in Castlecurragh Vale, Blanchardstown, Dublin 15.\r\nCastlecurragh Vale is a popular residential development located close to a host of local amenities, with Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, shops, schools, parks and public transport links all within easy reach. The N3 and M50 are also easily accessible.\r\nLiving accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen/dining area and downstairs toilet. Upstairs you will find three good-sized bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\nTo the rear is a private enclosed garden, while the property also benefits from off-street parking to the front.\r\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and offers bright and spacious accommodation in a convenient location.\r\nThis home is sure to appeal to a wide range of tenants, so please get in touch with Ray Cooke Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- 3 bed / 2 bath\r\n- Mid terrace house\r\n- Fantastic condition throughout\r\n- Can come furnished or unfurnished\r\n- Top quality windows & doors\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Very spacious rooms\r\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Generous rear garden\r\n- Private enclosed rear garden\r\n- Low maintenance rear garden\r\n- Peaceful location\r\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\r\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\r\n- Viewing highly advised\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE",
